{"seq":1,"slug":"the-1936-paper","title":"一九三六年的论文","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/alan-turing/major-works/on-computable-numbers/the-1936-paper","wordCount":2137,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"一九三六年的论文\">一九三六年的论文</h1><p>《论可计算数及其在判定问题上的应用》（On Computable Numbers, with an Application to the Entscheidungsproblem）是图灵于一九三六年完成、正式刊于《伦敦数学会会刊》第二辑第 42 卷第 230–265 页的论文。它的刊期标注横跨一九三六年十一月三十日与十二月二十三日两期，因而文献中常被引作 1936 年或 1937 年；一九三八年图灵又在同刊第 43 卷第 544–546 页发表了两页勘误（来源：<a href=\"https://londmathsoc.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1112/plms/s2-42.1.230\">London Mathematical Society / Wiley Online Library</a>；<a href=\"https://historyofinformation.com/detail.php?id=619\">History of Information</a>）。</p>\n<p>这篇论文的目标是回答希尔伯特提出的&quot;判定问题&quot;——是否存在一个机械步骤，能判定任意一阶逻辑公式是否普遍有效。图灵的回答是&quot;否&quot;，而为了让&quot;机械步骤&quot;这个含糊的直觉成为可严格推理的对象，他虚构了一台抽象机器，即后来所称的&quot;图灵机&quot;。本篇聚焦这篇论文的<strong>问题、结构与历史定位</strong>；图灵机的内部构造与&quot;通用机&quot;思想在 <a href=\"the-birth-of-the-turing-machine\">图灵机的诞生</a> 展开，不在此重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本篇的核心论断：<strong>这篇论文的真正猎物是判定问题，&quot;图灵机&quot;只是为达成这一证明而发明的工具——副产品却比原目标影响更深远。</strong> 理解它要抓住三点。</p>\n<p>其一是<strong>目标的绕行</strong>。图灵没有直接攻击判定问题，而是先定义&quot;可计算数&quot;（能被某台机器逐位打印的实数），为此发明图灵机，再用对角线法构造出一个定义明确却不可计算的数，最终归约出判定问题无解。其二，<strong>机器是论证工具</strong>。图灵当时的目标纯粹是数理逻辑，他并不想造计算机；&quot;通用机可作真实计算机蓝图&quot;这一认识是后来（尤其经冯·诺依曼）才被提炼出来的。其三，<strong>独特贡献是模型的直观性与等价性证明，而非时间优先</strong>。邱奇用 λ 演算早几个月得出否定结论，图灵靠论文附录里&quot;图灵可计算性 ⟺ λ 可定义性&quot;的等价证明站稳了位置。</p>\n<p>由此得到一个评价尺度：承载论文标题的&quot;可计算数&quot;是载体，判定问题才是目标，而顺带奠定的可计算性理论，最终成了整个计算机科学的地基。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[目标: 判定问题无解] --&gt; B[发明图灵机&lt;br/&gt;给机械步骤精确定义]&#10;    B --&gt; C[定义可计算数&lt;br/&gt;能被机器逐位打印的实数]&#10;    C --&gt; D[对角线法构造&lt;br/&gt;定义明确却不可计算的数]&#10;    D --&gt; E[归约: 判定问题无解]&#10;    E --&gt; F[副产品: 可计算性理论]&#10;    F --&gt; G[长成计算机科学的地基]\">flowchart TD\n    A[目标: 判定问题无解] --&gt; B[发明图灵机&lt;br/&gt;给机械步骤精确定义]\n    B --&gt; C[定义可计算数&lt;br/&gt;能被机器逐位打印的实数]\n    C --&gt; D[对角线法构造&lt;br/&gt;定义明确却不可计算的数]\n    D --&gt; E[归约: 判定问题无解]\n    E --&gt; F[副产品: 可计算性理论]\n    F --&gt; G[长成计算机科学的地基]</pre><h2 id=\"它要解决的问题-判定问题\">它要解决的问题：判定问题</h2><p>希尔伯特在一九二八年《数理逻辑基础》中把判定问题（Entscheidungsproblem，德语&quot;判定问题&quot;）列为数学基础的核心待决问题之一。它问的不是某个命题是否为真，而是：能否给出一个<strong>统一的、有限步骤的、机械可执行的过程</strong>，对一阶谓词逻辑的任意公式，判定它是否可证。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>希尔伯特的期望</th>\n<th>图灵的结论（1936）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>是否存在判定算法</td>\n<td>期望存在（纲领乐观）</td>\n<td>不存在</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;算法&quot;的定义</td>\n<td>直觉的、未形式化</td>\n<td>用图灵机精确刻画</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证明手法</td>\n<td>未指定</td>\n<td>对角线法 + 停机不可判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同期独立结果</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>邱奇用 λ 演算先行证伪（1936 年 4 月）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键背景：美国逻辑学家阿隆佐·邱奇（Alonzo Church）在一九三六年四月已用 λ 演算独立证明判定问题无解，比图灵投稿略早。图灵得知后在论文附录中证明了图灵机可计算性与 λ 可定义性<strong>等价</strong>，这一等价后来被称为&quot;邱奇–图灵论题&quot;（来源：<a href=\"https://plato.stanford.edu/entries/church-turing/\">Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy: The Church-Turing Thesis</a>）。这是论文得以发表、并未因撞车而埋没的关键——图灵的机器模型给出了远比 λ 演算更直观的&quot;可计算&quot;图像。</p>\n<h2 id=\"论证的骨架-从可计算数到不可判定\">论证的骨架：从可计算数到不可判定</h2><p>图灵的论证不是直接攻击判定问题，而是绕了一条更深的路。其逻辑链条如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;定义&#39;可计算数&#39;&lt;br/&gt;能被有限机器逐位算出的实数&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;定义图灵机&lt;br/&gt;给&#39;机械步骤&#39;一个精确模型&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;构造通用图灵机 U&lt;br/&gt;可模拟任意机器的描述&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;用对角线法证明&lt;br/&gt;&#39;停机&#39;问题不可判定&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;归约:若判定问题可解&lt;br/&gt;则停机可判定,矛盾&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;结论:判定问题无解&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"定义'可计算数'&lt;br/&gt;能被有限机器逐位算出的实数\"] --&gt; B[\"定义图灵机&lt;br/&gt;给'机械步骤'一个精确模型\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"构造通用图灵机 U&lt;br/&gt;可模拟任意机器的描述\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"用对角线法证明&lt;br/&gt;'停机'问题不可判定\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"归约:若判定问题可解&lt;br/&gt;则停机可判定,矛盾\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"结论:判定问题无解\"]</pre><p>每一步都对应论文中的具体小节：可计算数的定义（§1–§2）、机器的描述（§3–§5）、通用机（§6–§7）、不可计算序列与对角线论证（§8），最后在 §11 把判定问题归约到机器停机问题，完成证伪。</p>\n<p>为什么要先谈&quot;数&quot;？因为图灵把&quot;算法&quot;具体化为&quot;逐位产生一个无穷小数的过程&quot;。一个实数若存在某台图灵机能逐位无限地把它打印出来，就叫<strong>可计算数</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1328em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9072em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\">2</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8672em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1328em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 都是可计算数；但用对角线法可以构造出一个<strong>定义明确却不可计算</strong>的数——这正是判定问题无解的种子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对角线论证-不可计算性的来源\">对角线论证：不可计算性的来源</h2><p>图灵的核心技巧借自康托尔的对角线法。设想把所有&quot;会输出无穷小数的图灵机&quot;按其描述编码排成一列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_1, M_2, M_3, \\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span>，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 台机器输出的小数第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 位记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{ii}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ii</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。现在定义一个新数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>，它的第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 位取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - d_{ii}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ii</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（即与对角线处处相反）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>⋯</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta = 0.\\,b_1 b_2 b_3 \\cdots, \\qquad b_i = 1 - d_{ii}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ii</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 与列表中<strong>任何一台</strong>机器的输出都至少在某一位不同，因此没有任何图灵机能算出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>。这说明可计算数是可数的，而实数不可数——绝大多数实数其实&quot;算不出来&quot;。把这一不可计算性翻译回逻辑，就得到判定问题的否定回答。这里有一处图灵特意回避的陷阱：朴素的对角线构造会陷入自指悖论（机器试图算出&quot;与自己相反&quot;的位），图灵通过区分&quot;会循环机&quot;与&quot;满意机&quot;并论证后者不可判定，绕开了这一陷阱，而这恰是一九三八年勘误所修补的技术细节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"历史定位与常见误读\">历史定位与常见误读</h2><p>这篇论文常被称作&quot;二十世纪最重要的科学论文之一&quot;，但要准确理解它的地位，需厘清几个反模式式的误解：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>反模式一：以为图灵想造计算机。</strong> 图灵当时的目标纯粹是数理逻辑，机器只是证明工具。&quot;通用机可作为真实计算机蓝图&quot;的认识是后来（尤其经冯·诺依曼）才被提炼出来的。</li>\n<li><strong>反模式二：以为图灵第一个证伪判定问题。</strong> 邱奇略早。图灵的独特贡献是<strong>模型的直观性</strong>与<strong>等价性证明</strong>，而非时间上的优先。</li>\n<li><strong>反模式三：把&quot;可计算数&quot;当成论文主旨。</strong> 标题里的&quot;可计算数&quot;是载体，真正的猎物是判定问题；可计算性理论是顺带奠定的副产品，却比原目标影响更深远。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>权衡的视角：图灵选择&quot;机器&quot;而非纯逻辑语言来定义可计算，付出的代价是论证更冗长、技术细节更易出错（故有勘误），换来的回报是一个任何工程师都能理解的计算模型——这一权衡决定了它日后能跨出逻辑学、长成整个计算机科学的地基。</p>\n<p>延伸阅读：图灵机的内部机制见 <a href=\"the-birth-of-the-turing-machine\">图灵机的诞生</a>；图灵机作为计算模型的系统论述见 <a href=\"../../core-contributions/the-turing-machine/a-model-of-computation\">一种计算的模型</a>；可计算性与停机问题的方法论剖析见 <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/computability/the-limits-of-computation\">计算的极限</a> 与 <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/computability/the-halting-problem\">停机问题</a>；这篇论文如何长成数字文明的地基见 <a href=\"../../influence-and-legacy/shaping-the-digital-age/foundations-of-computing\">计算的基石</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>1936 年论文的目标是回答希尔伯特判定问题，图灵的回答是&quot;不存在通用判定算法&quot;。</li>\n<li>图灵机只是达成这一证明而发明的工具，&quot;可计算数&quot;是载体，真正的猎物是判定问题。</li>\n<li>论证链条为：定义可计算数与图灵机、构造通用机、用对角线法证明不可判定、再归约出判定问题无解。</li>\n<li>独特贡献是模型的直观性与&quot;图灵可计算性 ⟺ λ 可定义性&quot;的等价证明，而非时间上的优先（邱奇略早）。</li>\n<li>顺带奠定的可计算性理论比原目标影响更深远，论文的&quot;机器&quot;选择以论证冗长为代价，换来工程师也能理解的计算模型。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"参考来源\">参考来源</h2><ul>\n<li>London Mathematical Society / Wiley Online Library，《On Computable Numbers》卷期页码：<a href=\"https://londmathsoc.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1112/plms/s2-42.1.230\">https://londmathsoc.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1112/plms/s2-42.1.230</a></li>\n<li>History of Information，发表时间与背景：<a href=\"https://historyofinformation.com/detail.php?id=619\">https://historyofinformation.com/detail.php?id=619</a></li>\n<li>Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy，邱奇–图灵论题：<a href=\"https://plato.stanford.edu/entries/church-turing/\">https://plato.stanford.edu/entries/church-turing/</a></li>\n<li>论文全文（ETH Zürich 存档）：<a href=\"https://people.math.ethz.ch/~halorenz/4students/Literatur/TuringFullText.pdf\">https://people.math.ethz.ch/~halorenz/4students/Literatur/TuringFullText.pdf</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"一九三六年的论文","id":"一九三六年的论文"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"它要解决的问题：判定问题","id":"它要解决的问题-判定问题"},{"level":2,"text":"论证的骨架：从可计算数到不可判定","id":"论证的骨架-从可计算数到不可判定"},{"level":2,"text":"对角线论证：不可计算性的来源","id":"对角线论证-不可计算性的来源"},{"level":2,"text":"历史定位与常见误读","id":"历史定位与常见误读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"参考来源","id":"参考来源"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"图灵机的诞生","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/alan-turing/major-works/on-computable-numbers/the-birth-of-the-turing-machine"}}